<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Global Mass Funds — about the team behind our paper trading platform." />
  <title>About — Global Mass Funds</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,600;0,9..40,700;1,9..40,300&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/templatemo-622-clearwave.css" />
  <style>
    .gmf-video { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16/9; border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--accent); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .gmf-video img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    .gmf-video .gmf-video-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: var(--accent); opacity: 0.06; }
    .gmf-video .gmf-video-glow { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 14px, rgba(26,122,110,0.05) 14px, rgba(26,122,110,0.05) 15px); pointer-events: none; }
    .gmf-video .gmf-video-glow2 { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 10px, rgba(26,122,110,0.04) 10px, rgba(26,122,110,0.04) 11px); pointer-events: none; }
    .gmf-video-inner { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100%; width: 100%; }
    .gmf-video-tag { position: absolute; top: 20px; left: 20px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #fff; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 100px; backdrop-filter: blur(8px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
    .gmf-video-play { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; }
    .gmf-video-play svg { width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35); color: #fff; transition: background 0.4s var(--silk), border-color 0.4s var(--silk); }
    .gmf-video-play:hover svg { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
  <style>
    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .nav .nav-links { display: none; }
      .nav .nav-hamburger { display: flex; }
      .nav .nav-cta { display: none; }
      .nav .nav-cta-mobile { display: flex; }
      .nav .nav-hamburger + .nav-cta-mobile { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <%- include('partials/nav'); %>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-inner">
        <div class="cta-content">
          <div class="cta-label">About Global Mass Funds</div>
          <h2 class="cta-title">We build <em>paper trading</em> that matches real markets</h2>
          <p class="cta-sub">A global fund platform that lets you practice trading before committing real capital.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a href="/services" class="btn-cta-primary">Explore Services<span>→</span></a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-cta-ghost">Talk to a rep</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="features-header">
        <div class="section-label">Who We Are</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Traders, investors, <em>educators</em></h2>
        <p class="section-sub">Global Mass Funds was built by people who spent years in open markets and wanted a safer way to learn.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-list">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <div class="step-title">Founded by traders, for traders</div>
          <div class="step-desc">The team spent years managing paper and live accounts. We saw how easily new traders lose money to fees, leverage, and poor sizing — so we built a simulator that behaves like the real thing without the real risk.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <div class="step-title">A global platform</div>
          <div class="step-desc">Members across 40+ countries trade simulated BTC, ETH, and SOL every day. The platform is available in English with additional languages launching soon.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <div class="step-title">Real tools, real constraints</div>
          <div class="step-desc">Every order carries a 0.10% paper fee. The demo ledger is immutable, your balance is visible, and your risk limits are exactly what they'd be in a live account.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">4</div>
          <div class="step-title">Always improving</div>
          <div class="step-desc">We review the simulator quarterly against live market changes and introduce new assets, orders, and reporting as the ecosystem evolves.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

