          <p class="quote">"I went from watching crypto videos to placing real simulated orders in under an hour. The demo balance gives me room to make mistakes without guilt."</p>
          <div class="author"><div class="avatar">SK</div><div><div class="author-name">Sarah Kim</div><div class="author-role">Day Trader · NY</div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="quote-stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="quote">"Better than any tutorial. I learned position sizing, stop-loss habits, and how fees actually eat into a trade — all with fake money."</p>
          <div class="author"><div class="avatar">DC</div><div><div class="author-name">David Chen</div><div class="author-role">Portfolio Manager · Singapore</div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="quote-stars">★★★★★</div>
